   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 1
  }
  COA_MissionDescriptor "{64425051F2E00216}" {
   m_sTitle "BLUFOR Objectives"
   m_sTextData "Find and destroy 9 of the hidden caches in the town. Caches will emit a noise. Preserve at least 30% of your current force."\
   ""\
   "Notes"\
   "- You have an ammunition truck to keep sustained fighting going. Do not over equip beyond your starting allocation. "\
   "- This is a dense terrain, with house to house fighting and you need to preserve some force on the other side of the conflict. The worst thing to do is lose an entire squad to some few individuals in one part of town, when there's alternate targets available."
   m_aFactionKeys +{
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
  COA_MissionDescriptor "{64425051B9B5AF67}" {
   m_sTitle "OPFOR Objectives"
   m_sTextData "If OPFOR is playable, add mission objectives in bullet point list. Add details for each if you feel necessary, but keep it concise."
   m_aFactionKeys +{
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
  COA_MissionDescriptor "{644250519BE30999}" {
   m_sTitle "INDFOR Objectives"
   m_sTextData "Defend a majority of your hidden weapon caches, or destroy more than 70% of the enemy force. "\
   ""\
   "Notes:"\
   "- The terrain is dense with house to house fighting, and you do not need to eliminate the enemy in totality. You need to bleed the enemy as they move through the city without getting decisively engaged by the enemies superior firepower."
   m_aFactionKeys +{
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
  COA_MissionDescriptor "{6442505149CF6C93}" {
   m_sTitle "Administration"
